      "updated": 1763800000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Fail-Closed 命令静态审计与毁机硬熔断\nclassify_bash_command: 正则 + shlex 双层穿透 sudo/env/拆分选项\n硬拦截 rm -rf /|~、mkfs、dd 写块设备、Fork Bomb (含 full-auto!)\n封堵 GIT_EXTERNAL_DIFF / DYLD_* 等非白名单内联变量提权\n封堵含 / 路径 (./pytest) 防先 fs_write 恶意脚本再免审执行",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "p1_bash_cls",
      "originalText": "Fail-Closed 命令静态审计与毁机硬熔断\nclassify_bash_command: 正则 + shlex 双层穿透 sudo/env/拆分选项\n硬拦截 rm -rf /|~、mkfs、dd 写块设备、Fork Bomb (含 full-auto!)\n封堵 GIT_EXTERNAL_DIFF / DYLD_* 等非白名单内联变量提权\n封堵含 / 路径 (./pytest) 防先 fs_write 恶意脚本再免审执行",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
