      "text": "交互式链式审批 REPL 与动作防重放 (repl.py)\ndrain_approvals_interactively 支持 [y/n/a/f] 单键审批与提权\ninput_fn / output_fn 依赖注入实现无 PTY 确定性自动化回归\ncreate_action_proposal + mark_action_proposal_executed\n落盘动作回执，崩溃重启直接回放缓存结果绝不二次执行!",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "p1_repl",
      "originalText": "交互式链式审批 REPL 与动作防重放 (repl.py)\ndrain_approvals_interactively 支持 [y/n/a/f] 单键审批与提权\ninput_fn / output_fn 依赖注入实现无 PTY 确定性自动化回归\ncreate_action_proposal + mark_action_proposal_executed\n落盘动作回执，崩溃重启直接回放缓存结果绝不二次执行!",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
