      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "独立会话进程组 (PGID) 全树清场\nsubprocess.Popen(..., start_new_session=True) 创立独立进程组\n超时或取消时向整个 -pgid 发送 SIGTERM 并轮询 killpg(pgid, 0)\n宽限期未退尽补发 SIGKILL + finally 兜底，根除孙进程占管道挂死",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "h2_pgid",
      "originalText": "独立会话进程组 (PGID) 全树清场\nsubprocess.Popen(..., start_new_session=True) 创立独立进程组\n超时或取消时向整个 -pgid 发送 SIGTERM 并轮询 killpg(pgid, 0)\n宽限期未退尽补发 SIGKILL + finally 兜底，根除孙进程占管道挂死",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
